<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LATEST FRENCH OPEN WOMEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles results on the</p>
<p>fifth day of the French Open tennis tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Prefix number denotes seeding.</p>
<p>* denotes new results</p>
<p>Third round:</p>
<p>*2-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat Magui Serna (Spain) 7-6 (7-4) 6-1</p>
<p>*9-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Ann Grossman (U.S.) 6-1 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>11-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat Meike Babel (Germany) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat 15-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
</text>
